{
  "id": "mentornest-learning",
  "name": "MentorNest Learning",
  "description": "MentorNest Phase 2 learning plugin: profile v1/v2, learning records, deterministic math validator, hint ladder, learning event reader, mastery store, curriculum map, question bank (curator + quality agent), verified bank lookup, parent setup schema, coverage-driven AI authoring orchestrator, math-specialist independent answer verification, learning director (cross-subject weakness, prerequisite gap, weekly strategy). Phase 3-A: math specialist v2 + math visual engine (SVG v1) + math hint ladder v2 + word problem decomposer + prerequisite chain + math error taxonomy (12 tools: 11 + text-only companion). Phase 3-F: unified subject-v1 contract + cross-subject dispatcher + learning director v2 (11 tools). Phase 3.5: legacy mastery backfill (5 tools: dry_run, apply, status, rollback, classify_event). Phase 3.5-B: local TTS interface (sherpa-onnx-tts priority, 4 tools: tts_synthesize, tts_list_voices, tts_status, tts_hash_text). Phase 3.5-D: school_progress inferred TTL lifecycle (4 tools: status, mark_stale, promote, ttl_sweep; stale records remain on disk, never auto-promote to confirmed). Phase 4A: raw_question_ingest + raw_question_segment (pure, no disk writes; PDF/image binary inputs throw unsupported_in_round_4a).",
